{"symbol":"AARTECH","yahoo":"AARTECH.NS","bse":null,"isin":"INE01C001026","sme":null,"name":"Aartech Solonics Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Electrical Equipment & Parts","website":"https://aartechsolonics.com","about":"Aartech Solonics Limited operates as a system solution oriented research and development enterprise in the field of specialized and selected energy appliances in India and internationally. The company offers BTS 2000, a fast bus transfer system; control and relay panels, including main and auxiliary relays, annunciation relays, fuses, switches, wiring, terminal blocks; kranking ultracapacitors, built for engine cranking tasks; CLIP fault current limiters; best case; AC and DC UPS; flywheel, a mechanical energy storage device; load checker, a system for cutting off the mains supply if it detects excessive current; solar design and engineering services; and solid waste treatment. It also provides engineering solutions to utilities, industries, railways, renewable energy developers, and institutional customers in India and overseas. The company serves renewable and non-renewable energy, power T&D, heavy engineering, defense and exploration, healthcare, IT & telecom, waste management, non-renewables, and transportation industries. Aartech Solonics Limited was incorporated in 1982 and is based in Bhopal, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T09:57:46+00:00","quote":{"price":50.11,"prevClose":50.41,"marketCap":159.2,"high52":64.75,"low52":33.51,"pe":32.54,"bookValue":9.76,"dividendRate":0.13,"roe":null,"shares":3.177,"insiders":70.07,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2023-07-10","2023-07-11","2023-07-12","2023-07-13","2023-07-14","2023-07-17","2023-07-18","2023-07-19","2023-07-20","2023-07-21","2023-07-24","2023-07-25","2023-07-26","2023-07-27","2023-07-28","2023-07-31","2023-08-01","2023-08-02","2023-08-03","2023-08-04","2023-08-07","2023-08-08","2023-08-09","2023-08-10","2023-08-11","2023-08-14","2023-08-16","2023-08-17","2023-08-18","2023-08-